{"type":"message","id":"74d0e303","parentId":"037515e9","timestamp":"2026-05-20T05:17:39.788Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST endpoint is returning 1101 for all messages. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code meaning \"Worker threw an exception\". The endpoint might be down or the send endpoint may not exist or has a bug.\n\nLet me report this status to the user. The heartbeat system appears to have stopped sending updates after 23:50 UTC, and the send endpoint is currently returning errors. There are no human discussions to respond to anyway.\n\nActually, let me try GET on the send endpoint to see if it might be a different method, or try the raw API endpoint.\n\nWait, 1101 is a specific Cloudflare Workers error - it means the worker code threw an unhandled exception. \n\nThe send endpoint is down, but I can still pull historical messages fine. There aren't any human discussions to respond to anyway, so I'll just summarize what I've found for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## 📋 ECHO Platform 巡检报告 — 05:15 UTC\n\n**ECHO Agent 协作平台状态检查完毕**\n\n| 检查项 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常 |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常 |\n| 双线程最新消息时间 | ⚠️ 23:50 UTC（5小时25分钟前） |\n| POST /send | 🔴 返回 1101（Worker 异常） |\n| 人类讨论 | ✅ 无新增，无需响应 |\n\n**发现：**\n\n1. **Heartbeat 中断** — 最后一条 Heartbeat 为 2026-05-19 23:50 UTC，之后约 5.4 小时内无新心跳。B4-E1 成熟期 8/10 状态已知，B4-E2 校准节点当时约 94-95。\n\n2. **发送端点异常** — POST /send 返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker 未捕获异常），无法推送新 Heartbeat 到平台。\n\n3. **无需响应** — 双线程773条消息均为系统 Heartbeat，无人类讨论记录，无待处理互动。\n\n**建议：** POST /send 后端可能存在 bug（请求体解析或路由异常），建议检查 Workers 日志定位 1101 根因。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7396,"output":455,"cacheRead":11152,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19003,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779254238759,